# Server Context -- Infinite Room Labs Homelab

## What This Is

HP Z600 homelab server running the IRL self-hosted infrastructure.
Managed by Ansible from the laptop. Do not make manual changes.

## Server Details

- **OS**: Debian 12 Bookworm
- **CPU**: 2x Xeon X5650 (24 threads)
- **RAM**: {{ irl_total_ram_gb }}GB DDR3 ECC
- **Boot**: /dev/sda 233GB SSD (LVM)
- **Storage**: ZFS pool `{{ irl_zfs_pool }}` (3x 7.3TB RAIDZ1) at {{ irl_zfs_mount }}

